[{"client_msg_id":"91baa5bb-5a8d-45ac-98a8-f7d19a01ae1e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なので `go version -m` で現在のバージョンがわかったら `go install path@\u0026gt;{version}` みたいなことができるかも。ただコレは下回りの internal/modload/query.go の性能で、それがちゃんと go install から全部使えるようになってるか、までは追ってない。","ts":"1617795792.489500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Suxi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03f76a1c-7e86-4149-88a1-93fcafd24dcf","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`@\u0026gt;v1.2.3` みたいなとりかたできるな。","ts":"1617795714.488000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FOPpu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b05ed220-035a-49f5-b3b3-85056a9f3532","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あああ","ts":"1617795697.487600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"34O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c98cc89a-1ab7-455d-a6b6-c48cfdaac3ec","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`@latest` と `@upgrade` はほぼ一緒らしい。違いは current が新しい時に current が返るかリリースされた latest が返るか、かな。","ts":"1617795625.487400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qYBjc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37b2b9c8-7ded-4b6e-ab88-4bc543dd4c4c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"特殊な奴では `@upgrade` と `@patch` 指定があったな","ts":"1617795020.486300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zqo+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5099e29c-c5c4-4053-b959-0dcd34e25446","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"go installだと今は一度に別のバージョンを指定することはできなくなってるみたい。昔はそんなことなかったとおもうけど… いやgetだったかなぁあれは。まぁいまのほうが正しいとは思う。","ts":"1617794830.485900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"63cn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc9f6f45-2ce6-429a-bc29-434cf10d4b47","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"go.mod 直接弄ったほうが更新しやすいんだよなあ…","ts":"1617794725.484800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1ST9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"979cef21-738b-4894-b602-e55cb437c7a9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"go get はすでに go.mod と go.sum をいじるくんになっている (ついでにモジュールをダウンロードしてくるかもしれない) という認識でいました","ts":"1617794697.484400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yIcNA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56a37824-352c-4400-beff-798868a1d543","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あれ? go install 追ってたら、いつの間にかget相当の処理見逃した感あるぞ?","ts":"1617794549.483700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"76EG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2a8dbae-c458-4058-a009-6c5717c1ee49","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"んー `go get` と `go install` の違い、ちゃんと見とくかなぁ。","ts":"1617793819.483200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DX8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3711493-5540-410e-b14a-92e682054c8d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"`@latest`で物足りそうな雰囲気","ts":"1617792395.481800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zddoQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41ba111f-652b-4f52-8cae-22779fc12f5c","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"最新版を入れる時は脳死で `go install \u0026lt;package\u0026gt;@latest` してました (go 1.16)","ts":"1617792325.481300","edited":{"user":"UEACRCY0Z","ts":"1617792553.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SY3OM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2b3b67d-4a17-4d16-a4d5-07845659d50c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとガチでやろうとするとGO_PRRIVATEとか各種環境変数への対応も欲しくなってinternal公開してくれって思いながらコピペすることになる。","ts":"1617792213.480400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z5qw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cafe4022-5ede-4e58-8ca7-17e5136ab3d0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちょっと最近のgo installとgetの棲み分けの詳細は、まだ追ってないんだよねぇ。","ts":"1617791835.480300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A79a9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf8e3324-5f9e-45b0-a272-9411e37fa452","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ないケースは-uだったかなぁ。ただ現在バージョンをどう拾ってくるかのコードは真面目に追ってない。","ts":"1617791735.480100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KV/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73afd673-39fc-4eb0-99cc-365d36eae240","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そのケースではgo install path@upgradeあたりが正解かな。go.modが居るんだけも。go.modがないケースは、まだgo的なサポートはないかも。調べたらなんかあるかもだけど。","ts":"1617791679.480000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3fbD5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a76f01c-363e-4632-87b9-c54e0f532e0c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"単に `go install` で入れたバイナリを更新があった場合だけアップデートしたいだけです","ts":"1617791420.479900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M8fe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc3b6b03-92ae-4238-8b5a-aa78a4aaec4d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"最終的に何を実現したいのかわかってないんだけど、すでにgo内に実装されてるのをコピペして改造するのが、そのあたりは手っ取り早いかと。","ts":"1617791176.477700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jac"}]},{"client_msg_id":"151eb976-a46a-4ddd-ae44-92bd82e59c36","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"そこまで厳密じゃなくて良くて完全互換でなくても良いなら、 `go version` の結果をパースして `@latest` と比較でも良いかなと思いました\n```$ curl -s \"\u003chttps://proxy.golang.org/\u003e\"(go version -m ~/go/bin/misspell | egrep '^\\s*mod\\s' | awk '{print $2\"/@v/\"$3}').info\n{\"Version\":\"v0.3.2\",\"Time\":\"2018-03-09T00:50:08Z\"}\n$ curl -s \"\u003chttps://proxy.golang.org/\u003e\"(go version -m ~/go/bin/misspell | egrep '^\\s*mod\\s' | awk '{print $2}')/@latest\n{\"Version\":\"v0.3.4\",\"Time\":\"2018-03-09T01:55:12Z\"}```","ts":"1617791036.476800","edited":{"user":"UEACRCY0Z","ts":"1617791076.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U03C71D7H","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CvkC+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5115aa3b-2cfe-4e76-9858-e6dfaaedbb21","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"まあ普通に使う分には簡単じゃないかなあと思いますねえ\nmoduleとpackageの違いはちょい説明要るけど実用するときそんな気にする箇所でもないし","ts":"1617790743.474000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GRH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ee3b195-9923-44b5-992b-e4d87de2cb1d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"これってバイナリオーバーライドされないんですっけ?","ts":"1617790626.473200","thread_ts":"1617790368.468400","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mieq"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"1de74902-0cb1-4ad3-a4d1-b9112af840f9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`go install path/cmd1@v1.2.3`\n`go install path/cmd2@v1.2.4`\n\nみたいなことね。","ts":"1617790368.468400","thread_ts":"1617790368.468400","reply_count":8,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iue"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"1aab04d6-1854-4959-a588-84bea2b38611","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"go install で複数いっぺんにインストールできるの知らなかった","ts":"1617790614.473100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IJ8G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efcb0411-2c95-46ca-8cc6-345ce3df0971","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"腕力","ts":"1617790595.472700","team":"T03C4RC8V","r