.modを置く感じになります。","ts":"1617790404.469800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vFlWV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ae31871-362e-4ef0-b2d5-da2f9ebee65f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそもブランチを分けちゃうみたいなことか","ts":"1617790395.469500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3IN3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1de74902-0cb1-4ad3-a4d1-b9112af840f9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`go install path/cmd1@v1.2.3`\n`go install path/cmd2@v1.2.4`\n\nみたいなことね。","ts":"1617790368.468400","thread_ts":"1617790368.468400","reply_count":8,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iue"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7442c1f9-4934-4747-9d65-11874a84feda","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"別々にできるんですか","ts":"1617790324.467600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xnAT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c260c11a-0168-4447-a1ec-8b50acd8bbd8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"とはいえ別にすること自体は少ないかと。","ts":"1617790319.467500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mujU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a0f72a1-c67f-44cd-a3d8-69df36bf62fb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ですね。明示的に別々にしない限りは","ts":"1617790308.467000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Qg5g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c0bcfa2-307a-4008-9b12-67003a04f433","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"バージョンは package ではなくて module に付いてるんですね。\nということは 1 つの module から複数のバイナリを提供する場合、そいつらのバージョンは全部連動して同じになってしまう、ということかな","ts":"1617790282.466400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Re"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18863dbe-860a-4d6c-b288-ea9393858724","type":"me